        "aboutIntro": {
            "title": "About us",
            "text": "At number 27, Rua Eng. Von Haf, there is a place which combines the art of great cuisine with the tradition and values of the city of Aveiro. Pizzarte, a pizzeria that has been in operation for three decades, is a symbol of the region's identity. A place visited by several generations, who see Pizzarte as having the best pizzas in the city.<br/><br/>From Monday to Sunday, Pizzarte invests in its customers' smiles by offering a wide variety of pizzas, salads, pastas and delicious desserts, with quality service provided by a young and enthusiastic team.",
