            "title": "Our bar",
            "text": "With its cosmopolitan, irreverent and comfortable atmosphere, our Pizzeria’s bar offers the perfect way to end the day. When it opened in 1989, it revolutionised Aveiro's nightlife scene.<br/><br/>For many, the evening begins at the Pizzarte bar. We serve much-loved cocktails and signature gins. The walls are covered with phrases from books and films by national and international authors, giving the space a creative and artistic touch.",
